  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Running today",
      "items": [
        "One VPS runs the edge, control plane, database, a runtime node, the provisioner, the payments service, the Sia indexer, Falco and Suricata",
        "Accounts in region snp-eu get their own SEV-SNP VM, created on demand and deleted after two unused hours",
        "The original Aleph node serves accounts in region eu; everyone else runs on the VPS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How the stream connects",
      "items": [
        "VPS runtimes: phone to edge to virtnoded",
        "Remote runtimes: phone straight to the node over TLS pinned to its key; a confidential VM must pass the phone's attestation check first",
        "No direct route (e.g. no IPv6): the VPS node forwards the stream unchanged",
        "Remote nodes send heartbeats and fetch work through the edge, like phones"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundary",
      "items": [
        "SEV-SNP VMs: CPU-encrypted memory, measured boot, encrypted data disk unlocked only after attestation",
        "Still trusted there: the image builder, the provisioner, which holds the disk keys, and the control plane",
        "The VPS node and the Aleph node are ordinary hosts that can see their runtimes",
        "Only test builds verify the VMs until a signed measurement list is published"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Money and storage",
      "items": [
        "Each account has its own TRON deposit address; only the payments service holds the seed, and it checks every deposit on a second node",
        "Balances pay per runtime minute and per GB-day; new accounts get one runtime and an hour free",
        "Confidential VMs upload encrypted snapshots to Sia hosts and register them with indexd through the edge on :9982; indexd is still syncing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Next",
      "items": [
        "Finish indexd's sync and form its Sia contracts",
        "Publish a signed measurement list for release builds",
        "Convert deposits into SC and Aleph credits automatically",
        "QUIC streaming and a custom AOSP image"
      ]
    }
  ]
